00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.500
have a lot of lesser known rights

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.640
and freedoms as Americans.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.600
There is a deep well of obscure rights

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.500
