So let's talk about
more of the legal rights

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.460
that you have, but probably don't want

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.190
in any way, shape or form.

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:41.420
But quick legal disclaimer, as always,

